            "notes": "If you can afford it replace Angelesiure Wear with Martian Mender, now you will get passive health regen you won't need to activate angelic descent anymrore :) This combined with Serenity power just makes you a self sustain angel!\n\nTake Amari's Antidote if you acn afford it to keep up with the higher healing requirement as the enemy will have some good scaled up dmg by now in their items. \nHowever, you could also take Caduceus Ex if you feel like you are in danger and would prefer oto heal /boost from further away or if your team is running away too far (lol) or if you play with a  genji!\n\nBlessed boosters cuz it just feels amazing for movement. Now you can have fun zipping around with Serenity and Martian Mender passively regenning your health + don't forget about ur normal passive as well!!\n\nFill the rest of your items with WP/survival \nIf you're struggling at this point vs Junk/Solider/Freyja/Cree, buy some armor items like Iron Eyes.",
